      "id": "claim_f252a370c83b4a64b1c0ffcd823b59be",
      "statement": "POST /api/identify-batch prefetches the engine context concurrently with the Claude identification calls so a cold Airtable pull overlaps identification instead of adding to it, and runs with maxDuration=300 matching /api/identify's budget.",
